				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Initiated by SWFI, the Global Order Of Outstanding Disruptors (GOOD) Fellows is a non-profit endeavor and a tribute to the ‘Modern Greats of Wealth’, the audacious and visionary individuals who, through innovation, integrity, and commitment, are redefining the narrative of wealth.
</h2>		</div>
