				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">An integral part of the felicitation is the GOOD Talk. This is a 15-minute interactive dialog between each award recipient and the SWFI Chairman, Lakshmi Narayanan. Here the recipients share their vision and experiences, offering insights into their journey and the motivations behind their impactful work. The idea is to not only celebrate their achievements but also serve to inspire the audience, reinforcing the importance of using wealth and influence for the greater good.</span></p>						</div>
