				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
			<h2 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">World's Most Popular and Trusted Source on Institutional Investors and Global Capital</h2>		</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-48548ad animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="48548ad" data-element_type="widget" data-settings="{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<p>The Sovereign Wealth Fund Institute® (SWFI) is a global organization dedicated to study sovereign wealth funds, pensions, superannuation funds, family offices, central banks, endowments, and other long-term public investors in the areas of investing, asset allocation, risk, governance, economics, policy, trade, and other relevant issues.</p>
<p>We provide specialized research and consulting services to various corporations, funds, and governments. Our flagship publication, the Sovereign Wealth Quarterly, is the premier publication on public sector asset ownership and management globally.</p>						</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-ddef8d7 elementor-align-left elementor-tablet-align-center gf-btn elementor-mobile-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button" data-id="ddef8d7" data-element_type="widget" data-widget_type="button.default">
